cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these artefacts, please cite the article below."
title: "From Pixels to Faces: review artefacts and re-executable face inpainting/unmasking benchmark"
type: software
version: "v2.2"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mohamed-Abokhalil/From-Pixels-to-Faces"
url: "https://github.com/Mohamed-Abokhalil/From-Pixels-to-Faces"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24190797"
abstract: >-
  Scopus query and counts, supplementary search and full screening log, coded taxonomy, test-file lists with hashes,
  masks, per-method configurations with output provenance, evaluation code and per-image scores of the face inpainting
  and face unmasking benchmarks in "From Pixels to Faces". The generated outputs are archived in a separate Zenodo
  record (10.5281/zenodo.24193552; see zenodo_record.json).
keywords:
  - face inpainting
  - face unmasking
  - face completion
  - benchmark
  - systematic review
  - reproducibility
